  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You conjure a set of Artisan’s Tools of your choice, and you have proficiency with them. When the spell ends, the tools vanish, but anything made or transformed with them remains. The spell ends early if you cast it again or if the tools are more than 10 feet away from you.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> With a level 3 spell slot, you work as efficiently as two characters when determining how long it takes to craft nonmagical items with the tools.</p>",
